// TEMPLATE — copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same folder) and paste your
// key. `Secrets.xcconfig` is git-ignored, so your real key never gets
// committed or pushed to GitHub.
//
//   cp Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Get a key: https://developer.chargehub.com → subscribe to the
// "Starter (Free)" product → your Profile → copy the *Primary key*.
//
// Notes on .xcconfig syntax: no quotes around the value; `//` starts a
// comment (ChargeHub keys are hex, so this is not a problem); leading/
// trailing whitespace is trimmed.

CHARGEHUB_API_KEY = paste_your_chargehub_primary_key_here
